docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-10.md:763:| 27 | "The verifier fixes the required set." (C4, claim cell) | A9:143 (C4) | Added after it: "The release-signed trust configuration lists D's authorized service-key schedule; the receipt's key pair and window pass only by an exact listed match, under A10.4.1's ordered classifier (`SERVICE_KEYS_NOT_LISTED`, `TRUST_HORIZON`)." Non-claim added: "The listing gives non-acceptance within A10.4.1's scope, not issuer detection or public visibility." Option (e) only. **AUTHOR ADOPTED 2026-10-18** (recommended by the owner and Codex) | BROADEN | B |
