saction formats (Bitcoin Core source)"},{"digest_sha256":"d68f9898a104c911352e0dc4f6e6f5370d188c0344d75e7a7b3642cf663f57f9","edition":"ECMA-262 10th edition, June 2019 (the edition RFC 8785 cites)","errata":"Ecma publishes no errata for this edition; later editions rename the operation Number::toString (6.1.6.1.20 in ES2020 and later) without changing its output.","failure_consequence":"Number serialization (ES) undefined: the number rule (profile section 10) and JCS number output cannot be reproduced; the profile's restated ES recipe and vectors N-01..N-22 remain.","id":"ecma-262","redistribution":"Ecma copyright; Ecma's notice permits copying and distributing the unmodified standard. Not distributed with the verifier or the spec; retrieved by reference (digest above).","retrieval":"https://ecma-international.org/wp-content/uploads/ECMA-262_10th_edition_june_2019.pdf fetched 2026-10-19T23:31:05Z; HTML form https://262.ecma-international.org/10.0/ (RFC 8785's cited URL https://www.ecma-international.org/ecma-262/10.0/index.html redirects there), HTML sha256 36906ca3fdf102aef621487c34c3f1b1f12fa11a4e58cd12c9e9c00013e298f0 fetched 2026-10-19T23:31Z","sections":["7.1.12.1 NumberToString(m), including Note 2","24.5.2.2 QuoteJSONString (RFC 8785 erratum 6292)"],"title":"ECMA-262 ECMAScript 2019 Language Specification: NumberToString (the profile's Number::toString)"},{"digest_sha256":"0455b406d89648d20cbde375561e19c245b9815e894164c2670772e3d54deb82","edition":"FIPS 180-4, August 2015","errata":"No errata list published. CSRC planning note (03/07/2023): NIST has decided to revise FIPS 180-4; this edition is pinned regardless of any revision.","failure_consequence":"No hash can be computed: every frame, anchor, fingerprint, OTS op and Bitcoin link fails; no verdict.","id":"fips-180-4","redistribution":"Work of the US Government, not subject to copyright in the US; redistributable. Not distributed with the verifier or the spec; retrieved by reference (digest above).","retri