ched 2026-10-19T23:31:00Z","sections":["6.2 SHAKE256"],"title":"FIPS 202 SHA-3 standard (SHAKE256)"},{"digest_sha256":"57239b9f84c03227eda3ca0991204dc7764c79af9ce2e6824eda774918d46b6b","edition":"FIPS 204, August 13, 2024","errata":"CSRC potential-updates spreadsheet, last updated 7/31/2026 (archived, formal/dependency-sources/archive/errata/fips-204-potential-updates.xlsx, sha256 5bc93ce63bc647e6d1d456cb2d3a171426c15aca4a7a0e0edd40d08b7a34c793): NTT wording (2.5, 7.5), M to M' (6.2, 6.3), c-tilde order wording (3.3), Algorithm 3 step 2 returns false, Algorithm 40 bound, Table 1 repetitions and Table 3 loop limit. None changes a verification outcome; the Algorithm 3 change (false instead of bottom) is ADOPTED as the reading. No official errata.","failure_consequence":"Hybrid only: the kms ML-DSA-65 slot cannot be verified; under the registered hybrid a receipt then has no VALID_STRICT path.","id":"fips-204","redistribution":"Work of the US Government, not subject to copyright in the US; redistributable. Not distributed with the verifier or the spec; retrieved by reference (digest above).","retrieval":"https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/FIPS/NIST.FIPS.204.pdf fetched 2026-10-19T23:30:59Z","sections":["Algorithms 2, 3, 7, 8 (sign/verify, external mu)","7.2 pkDecode/sigDecode encodings","Table 1 ML-DSA-65 parameters"],"title":"FIPS 204 Module-lattice-based digital signature standard (ML-DSA-65)"},{"digest_sha256":"40a1fd5254f3057508feeaa188a1dcf9b2ca0c2d61ad72015b33804903997fe2","edition":"git v2.56.0 fsck.c (commit a018953688f1b10bddf91bff8747068f5f4746a4) and Pro Git 2nd ed. section 10.2 (progit2 commit a013e3230a1207cfa5ae94d28ba7d2021063c337)","errata":"No formal specification or errata exist; profile section 15.4 is the normative restatement.","failure_consequence":"Git ids, trees and commits lose their external reference; profile section 15.4 restates them.","id":"git-object-format","redistribution":"fsck.c GPL-2.0; Pro Git CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 (non-commercial redistribution); archived in formal/dependency-sources/archive/git-object-format/.","retrieval":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/git/git/a018953688f1b10bddf91bff8747068f5f4746a4/fsck.c and https://raw.githubusercontent.com/progit/progit2/a013e3230a1207cfa5ae94d28ba7d2021063c337/book/10-git-internals/sections/objects.asc fetched 2026-10-19T23:31:42Z; digest is of SHA256SUMS","sections":["Object header '<type> <len>\\0'","Commit headers","Tree entries, modes and sort order (fsck.c verify_ordered)"],"title":"git object format: object header, commit and tree encoding, tree ordering"},{"digest_sha256":"e99e9de49bb4d7566199956a44e886643faaf68333974ed055099a310595daf4","edition":"git v2.56.0, commit a018953688f1b10bddf91bff8747068f5f4746a4","errata":"Documentation; no errata.","failure_consequence":"The git signed payload loses its external reference; profile section 15.4 restates it.","id":"gitformat-signature","redistribution":"GPL-2.0 (git); redistributed. Archived in formal/dependency-sources/archive/gitformat-signature/.","retrieval":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/git/git/a018953688f1b10bddf91bff8747068f5f4746a4/Documentation/gitformat-signature.adoc fetched 2026-10-19T23:31:42Z","sections":["Commit signatures (gpgsig header, signed payload)"],"title":"gitformat-signature(5): git cryptographic signature formats"},{"digest_sha256":"67ebe016ca90fa7688ce67a387ebd82c6261e95897db7b23df24ff335be85bc6","edition":"GnuPG 2.4.4 upstream source (as observed; release R3/R6 'pinned gpgv' version not yet decided)","errata":"Not applicable (software). Observed relying-party binary on the owner machine is Ubuntu 2.4.4-2ubuntu17.6, a patched build whose bytes differ from upstream.","failure_consequence":"Release authentication only: a release cannot be authenticated, so the verifier's own authenticity rests on assumption (contract section 2). No bundle verdict changes.","id":"gpgv","redistribution":"GPL-3.0; not distributed with the verifier; the relying party installs it.","retrieval":